Guide to Thin Section Microscopy — Raith, Raase, and Reinhardt (@mp-microscopy: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mp-sources) { r_2MH30T4MGW8YMVP9SA3Z7XCDSD
Michael M. Raith, Peter Raase, and Jürgen Reinhardt. Guide to Thin Section Microscopy, second edition, 2012, 127 pages. English ISBN 978-3-00-037671-9. [MSA's authorized editions and downloads](https://msaweb.org/guide-to-thin-section-microscopy/).

Read the entire guide and perform its procedures under suitable instrument guidance. It connects microscope adjustment/imaging, mineral morphology/optical observations, deformation features, interference, and length/angle/thickness measurements. It is a practical guide rather than a complete theoretical optics text or tabulated mineral catalogue.

The same official page supplies Guia para Microscopia de minerais em lâminas delgadas, translated by Maria do Carmo Gastal and Marcia Elisa B. Gomes, Portuguese ISBN 978-3-00-046279-5. Free authorized reading/downloads are established; preserve actual edition/component rights rather than asserting a blanket adaptation licence. The reduced English PDF exceeded the reader's size limit. Identity, scope, languages, and download routes checked on 29 October 2026. External only.

**Return:** [Mineralogy and petrology sources — books, laboratories, analytical methods, and research](../Sources.lingua#r_38Q6Z3J7ER2G1B441JXJ14NV5A).
